# Research manifests hash the ORIGINAL bytes of source/notebook/metadata files.
# Disable line-ending conversion even when the machine has core.autocrlf=true.
# -text does not disable normal textual diffs; it only disables normalization.
* -text
* whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol

*.joblib binary
*.pkl binary
*.pickle binary
*.npz binary
*.npy binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.zip binary
*.bundle binary
